    "title": "Air quality advisory reissued for Wallowa County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Garrett Christensen ,\n1 days ago WALLOWA COUNTY — Attention Wallowa County residents, the Oregon Department of Environmental Quality (DEQ) has issued another air quality advisory for portions of the county. As of the morning, Wallowa County along with Crook, Jefferson, and southern Wasco Counties are now under the new advisory through at least Friday afternoon. Read full article",
